ff951\">在智能体的</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u0e264373\" id=\"u0e264373\">人设与回复逻辑</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u6a1876f9\" id=\"u6a1876f9\">内，声明智能体使用 </span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u180e2e66\" id=\"u180e2e66\">weather_news_workflow</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u85007303\" id=\"u85007303\"> 工作流处理任务。 </span></li></ol><p data-lake-id=\"ua3a82b5d\" id=\"ua3a82b5d\"><span data-lake-id=\"u318a4b1c\" id=\"u318a4b1c\">例如 </span><span data-lake-id=\"ue3350327\" id=\"ue3350327\">在用户要求查看天气时，调用 weather_news_workflow 工作流查看天气</span><span data-lake-id=\"u55879e51\" id=\"u55879e51\">。 </span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ubb0f334e\" id=\"ubb0f334e\"><span data-lake-id=\"u96b454fe\" id=\"u96b454fe\">编写后，你可以单击</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u2020a942\" id=\"u2020a942\">优化</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"uaca2989f\" id=\"uaca2989f\">，让 AI 帮助你生成结构化的回复逻辑。 </span></p><ol list=\"u8e666a33\" start=\"5\"><li fid=\"u99fda20a\" data-lake-id=\"u8af6ae6e\" id=\"u8af6ae6e\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7b577869\" id=\"u7b577869\">在智能体的右侧</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ue443f61a\" id=\"ue443f61a\">预览与调试</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u8aed1507\" id=\"u8aed1507\">区域，输入内容预览智能体实现的效果。 </span></li></ol><p data-lake-id=\"u77fa6908\" id=\"u77fa6908\"><span data-lake-id=\"u57567eb5\" id=\"u57567eb5\">例如输入 长沙天气。 </span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u0dc9f822\" id=\"u0dc9f822\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F2424104%2F1744272348388-82c4c78b-9a2b-471d-aaaa-a03a83e25e16.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22uea50f28d-ed9a-402f-a65d-ab05d99fc55%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u60467ac0-dc77-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A462.42421569684257%2C%22height%22%3A544%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A192686%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A763%2C%22originHeight%22%3A898%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.6500000953674316%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22sty